{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Sign","lean:module:Mathlib.GroupTheory.Perm.Fin","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Perm","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.DeriveFintype"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.mixed_colour_excludes_symmetric_flavour","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.mixed_colour_excludes_symmetric_flavour","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/ColourChannelSpinStatistics.lean#L118-L122","doc":"With colour `(2,1)` (the alternative non-singlet channel), spin `(3)` and space `(3)`, the\nflavour channel must be `(2,1)`; flavour `(3)` (the `Δ⁺⁺` flavour channel) is excluded. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.no_groundstate_flavour_singlet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.no_groundstate_flavour_singlet","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/ColourChannelSpinStatistics.lean#L112-L116","doc":"With colour `(1³)` and space `(3)`, a spin channel in `{(3), (2,1)}` (at most two rows,\ni.e. a level-2 channel) never pairs with flavour `(1³)`: no ground-state flavour singlet. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.colour_channel_forced","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.colour_channel_forced","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/ColourChannelSpinStatistics.lean#L107-L110","doc":"**Only colour `(1³)` admits spin `(3)`, flavour `(3)`, space `(3)`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.signMult_anti","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.signMult_anti","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/ColourChannelSpinStatistics.lean#L101-L105","doc":"Colour `(1³)`, space `(3)`: the sign multiplicity is `1` exactly when the spin channel\nequals the flavour channel. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.signMult","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.signMult","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/ColourChannelSpinStatistics.lean#L96-L99","doc":"`|S₃|` times the multiplicity of the sign representation in\n`colour ⊗ spin ⊗ flavour ⊗ space`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.dims","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.dims","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/ColourChannelSpinStatistics.lean#L92-L94","doc":"Dimensions (character values at the identity) are `1, 2, 1`, and `Σ dim² = |S₃|`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.chars_orthonormal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.chars_orthonormal","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/ColourChannelSpinStatistics.lean#L88-L90","doc":"The three characters are orthonormal: `|S₃| · ⟨χ_a, χ_b⟩ = 6 δ_{ab}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.gram","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.gram","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/ColourChannelSpinStatistics.lean#L85-L86","doc":"`|S₃|` times the inner product `⟨χ_a, χ_b⟩`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.chi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.chi","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/ColourChannelSpinStatistics.lean#L79-L83","doc":"The irreducible character of `S₃` labelled by a channel. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.fixedPts","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.fixedPts","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/ColourChannelSpinStatistics.lean#L75-L77","doc":"Number of fixed points of a permutation of `Fin 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.instReprChannel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.instReprChannel","kind":"instance","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/ColourChannelSpinStatistics.lean#L71-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChannelSpinStatistics.instReprChannel.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.ColourChan